  "created": "2026-10-23T14:59:19.55Z",
  "description": "A firmware-agnostic translation of the Infineon CYW43439's host interface as wired on the Raspberry\n      Pi Pico 2 W into a virtual network: the gSPI bus (bit-banged through PIO), the backplane and firmware\n      download (the radio firmware is parked, never executed), and the SDPCM/WLC control + Ethernet data\n      plane. The chip itself is not emulated (no RF, no chip internals), so unmodified firmware (pico-sdk,\n      MicroPython, CircuitPython) runs in STA and SoftAP modes against a virtual access point.",
